# Kept out of what `vercel deploy` uploads: secrets, local tooling and caches,
# and data that must never leave the machine (the BHH benchmark is CC-BY-NC).
**/.env*
!apps/web/.env.production
!**/.env.example
.claude
.agents
skills-lock.json
assets
apps/agent/evals/data
apps/agent/evals/results
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
